          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-inner editorial-split"
              },
              "html": "<div><p class=\"section-label\">A night at home</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">What can couples do at home on December 31?</h2></div><div class=\"intent-prose\"><p>You may have chosen to stay in or simply have nothing planned for New Year’s Eve. You can still mark the occasion: a different meal, a playlist and something to share before wishing each other a happy new year.</p>\n<p>Pick one or two of these seven ideas. Cook a festive dinner or order something, dress up or stay comfortable. Choose the evening you both want.</p></div>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "ideas-section"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-inner"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "ideas-heading"
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-label"
                      },
                      "html": "Made for sharing"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h2",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-title"
                      },
                      "html": "Seven ideas for New Year’s Eve together"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "ol",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "ideas-grid"
                  },
                  "html": "<li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">01 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"m21 15-5-5L5 21\"/></svg></div><h3>Start with drinks and snacks</h3><p>Prepare a few things to snack on and a drink you enjoy. Sharing an aperitif can make it feel like the evening has begun, even if you are staying in your own living room.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">02 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 10h8v11H8zM12 10V8M12 8c5-1 2-5 0-7-2 2-5 6 0 7Z\"/></svg></div><h3>Have dinner you both enjoy</h3><p>Cook at home, collect takeout or order from a favorite restaurant. Choose according to your mood and budget. Check opening times if you are ordering for December 31 and remember dessert.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">03 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 18V5l12-2v13M9 9l12-2\"/><ellipse cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"18\" cy=\"16\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3>Take turns choosing music</h3><p>One person picks a track, then the other chooses the next. Talk, dance in the living room or keep the music on during dinner. A playlist is all you need.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card featured\"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">04 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14v-3a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v3\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"17\" y=\"12\" width=\"5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></div><h3>A little anticipation… or more after midnight</h3><p>Try audio together before the celebrations if you have time to enjoy it, or after the toast to carry on the evening. Discover the voice with a free demo; a personalized session uses a paid credit.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card wide\"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">05 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"m3 6 9 7 9-7\"/></svg></div><h3>The midnight countdown, together</h3><p>Keep your glasses ready: champagne or an alcohol-free drink of your choice. At midnight, make time for the countdown, good wishes and the first kiss of the year if you both feel like it. Your Caresse moment can come before or be saved for afterwards.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">06 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.8A9 9 0 0 1 11.2 3 9 9 0 1 0 21 12.8Z\"/></svg></div><h3>Play a game for two</h3><p>Get out a pack of cards or a game you already know. If you would enjoy an intimate activity guided by a voice, you can also discover the Caresse audio format. Choose what appeals to both of you.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">07 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 2.6 6.4L21 12l-6.4 2.6L12 21l-2.6-6.4L3 12l6.4-2.6L12 3ZM21 2v4M19 4h4\"/></svg></div><h3>Plan a relaxed first morning</h3><p>If you are not working the next day, have something ready for a good breakfast and enjoy the morning. You can also move your evening to January 1 if December 31 is already booked.</p></li>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
