                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "demo-note"
                      },
                      "html": "For adult couples of all genders and orientations. Either person can suggest, decline, pause or stop at any time. Surprise each other with the setting; choose preferences and boundaries together."
