                      },
                      "html": "Good to know"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h2",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-title",
                        "id": "faq-title"
                      },
                      "html": "Before you plan your evening"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-list"
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>How can we spend New Year’s Eve together on a budget?</summary><p>Make a simple meal, choose some music and get out a game you already own. Caresse demos are free; generating personalized audio uses a paid credit, without a subscription.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>Can we plan New Year’s Eve at the last minute?</summary><p>Yes. Pick food that is easy to prepare or collect, a drink for a toast and an activity you both like. Check shop opening times if you need to buy anything on December 31.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>How can we have New Year’s Eve together without a babysitter?</summary><p>Start with time as a family, then keep a moment for yourselves once the children are asleep. Choose a meal and activity that you can move around as the evening unfolds.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>When should we start Caresse so we do not miss the midnight countdown?</summary><p>Choose a moment before midnight if you have enough time, or save the experience for after the countdown and toast. Generation time and personalized audio length can vary; waiting until after midnight is better than rushing to finish in time.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>Does a New Year’s Eve for two have to be romantic?</summary><p>Make it festive, quiet, playful or intimate according to your mood. Audio is something to choose together; stay with dinner, a game or a film if that is what you prefer.</p>"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
